  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nHello there! Would you like to play a game of Black Jack?",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n您好！想玩一局21点吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "What are the rules?",
      "translation" : "规则是什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "I want to play.",
      "translation" : "我想玩。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "No thanks.",
      "translation" : "不用了，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nWhat would you like to know?",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n您想了解什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "The basics.",
      "translation" : "基本规则。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "Winning and loosing.",
      "translation" : "胜负判定。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "'Double Down'.",
      "translation" : "“加倍下注”。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "Ace value.",
      "translation" : "A的点数。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "Nothing.",
      "translation" : "没什么。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nBlack Jack is a card game in which the goal is to get 21, or as\nclose to 21 points as possible, without going over 21.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n21点是一种纸牌游戏，目标是让点数达到21点，或尽可能接近21点，但不能超过21点。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nBefore the game starts, the player must make a bet.  Once the bet\nhas been made, both the dealer and the player are dealt 2 cards\neach.  Depending on what cards you have, you can choose to ^5533FF'stay'^000000,\nor you can choose to ^5533FF'pull'^000000.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n游戏开始前，玩家必须下注。下注后，荷官和玩家各发两张牌。根据您手中的牌，您可以选择^5533FF“停牌”^000000，也可以选择^5533FF“要牌”^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nWhen you choose to 'stay', you are telling the dealer that you don't\nneed anymore cards.  This allows the dealer to pull if he/she\nwants to.  In order to stay, you must have ^FF3355at least 13 points^000000. The\ndealer can only stay when he/she has^FF3355 17 points or more^000000.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n当您选择“停牌”时，表示您不需要更多牌了。这样荷官就可以选择是否要牌。要停牌，您的点数必须^FF3355至少为13点^000000。荷官只有在点数^FF3355达到17点或以上^000000时才能停牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nWhen you choose to 'pull', you are telling the dealer that you want\nanother card.  By pulling more cards you can increase your point\ntotal.  As long has you have ^FF3355less than 21^000000 points you can pull a\ncard from the deck.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n当您选择“要牌”时，表示您想要一张牌。通过要牌可以增加您的总点数。只要您的点数^FF3355低于21点^000000，就可以从牌堆中要一张牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nThere are 3 ways to win and loose at Black Jack.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n在21点中，有3种方式决定胜负。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\n1.) At the end of a Black Jack round, if you have more points\nthan the dealer you will win the round.  Conversely if you have\nless points than the dealer you will loose.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n1.) 在一局21点结束时，如果您的点数比荷官高，您就赢了。反之，如果您的点数比荷官低，您就输了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\n2.) If you pull a card that makes your point total go over 21 you\nwill automatically loose the round.  This is called a ^5533FF'bust'^000000.  If\nthe dealer busts then you will win the round.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n2.) 如果您要牌后总点数超过21点，您会自动输掉这一局。这被称为^5533FF“爆牌”^000000。如果荷官爆牌，您就赢了这一局。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\n3.) If you have a point total of 21 with the first 2 cards, you\nwill automatically win the round.  This is called a ^5533FF'Black Jack'^000000\nand happens when you get an 'Ace' and a '10 valued' card. If the\ndealer gets a Black Jack he/she will automatically win the round.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n3.) 如果您用前两张牌就达到了21点，您会自动赢下这一局。这被称为^5533FF“21点”^000000，通常由一张“A”和一张“10点牌”组成。如果荷官也拿到21点，他会自动赢下这一局。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\n4.) Besides winning and loosing, you can tie with the dealer.  If\nboth you and the dealer have the same point total at the end of a\nround, this will result in a tie with no winner and no loss or gain\nin money.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n4.) 除了胜负之外，您还可能与荷官平局。如果一局结束时您和荷官的点数相同，结果就是平局，不输不赢，也不增加或减少金钱。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nThis is called a ^5533FF'push'^000000 with the dealer.  This also\napplies to both you and the dealer having Black Jack at the same\ntime.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n这被称为与荷官^5533FF“平局”^000000。如果双方都拿到21点，同样适用此规则。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nThe 'Double Down' option allows you to double your current bet,\nbut with the drawback that you will only be able to pull one\nadditional card.  This option is only available at the beginning of\neach round.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n“加倍下注”选项允许您将当前下注翻倍，但缺点是只能再要一张牌。此选项仅在每局开始时可用。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nAn example of when doubling down is useful, is when\nyour first 2 cards give you a point total of 11.  You have a good\nchance of getting 21 or 20 with the next card that you draw.  This\nwould be a good hand to double down on.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n适合加倍下注的情况是，当您的前两张牌总点数为11点时。您有很大的机会通过下一张牌达到21点或20点。这是一个适合加倍下注的好牌型。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nThe 'Ace' card is a unique card in the game of Black Jack because\nit can have 2 values.  An Ace can be counted as either 11 points,\nor just 1 point.  For example if you had an Ace and a 4, that would\ngive you either 15 or 5 points.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n在21点游戏中，“A”是一张特殊的牌，因为它有两种点数。A可以算作11点，也可以算作1点。例如，如果您有一张A和一张4，那么您的点数可以是15点，也可以是5点。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nIf you decided to stay, the Ace would automatically be counted as\n11 points to give you 15 points total.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n如果您选择“停牌”，A将自动算作11点，使您的总点数达到15点。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nIf you had decided to pull and received a 9, the ace would\nautomatically be counted as 1 point to give you a total of 14\npoints.  If the Ace was counted as 11 points, you would have a\npoint total over 21 and would have lost.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n如果您选择“要牌”并抽到了一张9，A将自动算作1点，使您的总点数达到14点。如果A算作11点，您的总点数将超过21点，从而输掉这一局。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nIt is because of the flexibility you have with the 'Ace' that makes\nit the most powerful card in the game.",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n正是由于“A”的这种灵活性，使它成为游戏中最强大的牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nFeel free to come back anytime",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n欢迎随时回来"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Dealer]\nPlease place your bets...",
      "translation" : "[荷官]\n请下注..."
    },
